      "role": "user",
      "content": "i thought i was doing the right thing. i thought if i spoke up about what they were doing at the firm, things might actually change or people would care. instead, it just ruined everything. i lost my job, my reputation is trashed, and the people who did it are still in power like nothing happened. it feels like there's no point in being a good person if the world just rewards the people who lie and cheat. what's even the point of trying anymore?",
