    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"inspire others\"? that's not how it works. they didn't just ignore me, they made sure nobody would ever trust me again. i can't even get a coffee shop job because of how they've painted me. there is no \"reform\" coming. the whole system is just designed to protect people like them and crush people like me. it feels like the more you care, the more it hurts, and the more you lose. i'm just tired of fighting a battle that was lost before i even started.",
